expected_issues.description:
Avoid `Math.random()` for React keys. If `row.id/_id` is missing, this key changes every render, causing Tooltip/TableRow to remount and hurting performance. Prefer requiring a stable id, or use a deterministic fallback (e.g., index) with known caveats.

```suggestion
       // Prefer stable IDs; avoid Math.random() as a React key
       const key = row.id ?? row._id; // ensure callers provide a stable id
       // If you must fallback, use a deterministic value (e.g., index) rather than Math.random().
```

